# Final review — etude-9uf.3: Delete the retroactive capture path

## The change

15 files, +458 / −1008. Net −550 lines.

Three scripts deleted (974 lines): `dogfood-capture.sh`, `dogfood-close.sh`,
`dogfood-close_test.sh`. One file added: `scripts/pre-push_test.sh` (388), the
extracted hook suite. Twelve files swept.

`.lane-done` is untracked operator state and is excluded by staging every path
explicitly.

